{
  "info": {
    "name": "PAD TEAM 7 — World Service",
    "description": "World Service (port 8004) — see section 4 of the CPR README. Run the folders in order (Collection Runner works). Needs AUTH_DEV_TOKENS=true for the test tokens.",
